       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-UNIFIED-CLOSURE-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-UNIFIED-ALGEBRAIC-CLOSURE.
           05  WS-WEYL-CLOSURE-SOUND       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LIE-BRACKET-CLOSED       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOPOLOGICAL-SKYRMION-MET PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-UNIVERSAL-ALGEBRA-CLOSED PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-CLOSURE-VERIFICATION.
           05  WS-ISOMORPHISM-EXACT        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-UNIFIED-CODE       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-UNIFIED-ALGEBRA.
           PERFORM 2000-SYNTHESIZE-TOTAL-CLOSURE.
           GOBACK.
       1000-VERIFY-UNIFIED-ALGEBRA.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-WEYL-CLOSURE-SOUND.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LIE-BRACKET-CLOSED.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TOPOLOGICAL-SKYRMION-MET.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ISOMORPHISM-EXACT.
       2000-SYNTHESIZE-TOTAL-CLOSURE.
           IF WS-WEYL-CLOSURE-SOUND = 1 AND
              WS-LIE-BRACKET-CLOSED = 1 AND
              WS-TOPOLOGICAL-SKYRMION-MET = 1 AND
              WS-ISOMORPHISM-EXACT = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-UNIVERSAL-ALGEBRA-CLOSED
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-UNIFIED-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-UNIVERSAL-ALGEBRA-CLOSED
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-UNIFIED-CODE.
